4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The castle was infiltrated by Longris, as well as others from the Golden Dawn who had been possessed by elves.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Yami and Finral were soon forced into a harrowing battle.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
It doesn't matter how many of you there are, you'll never overpower us!

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Keke! You're exactly the ones I want to slice on! So thanks for coming out!

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
With Jack's aid, they gained the upper hand.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000
After regrouping with Nozel and the others, the team entered the castle.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
