I trained you better than to start eating before I do!

48
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:57,540
If it makes you

49
00:03:57,540 --> 00:04:00,540
If it makes you angry, then do something about it!

50
00:04:04,540 --> 00:04:10,540
With a face like that? It must be hard to look in the mirror. You're lucky I'm always so kind to you.

51
00:04:14,540 --> 00:04:20,540
That sad grimoire of yours is practically paper thin. Are you sure you're really royalty?

52
00:04:20,540 --> 00:04:25,540
Not being able to control your own magic. That's the most pitiful thing I've ever heard.

53
00:04:25,540 --> 00:04:29,540
And this wretch is my little sister? Embarrassing.

54
00:04:29,540 --> 00:04:35,540
You will never be a member of my squad. There is no room in the Silver Eagles for a disgrace like you.

55
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:41,540
So sad.

56
00:04:41,540 --> 00:04:43,540
Pitiful.

57
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:48,540
And would you believe the girl's been going outside alone every night so that she can practice her abilities on a dead tree?

58
00:04:48,540 --> 00:04:54,540
The best part is, she always misses. Every once in a while a spell will backfire on her and she ends up soaked.

59
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:56,540
It's hilarious!

60
00:04:56,540 --> 00:05:05,540
Really? I couldn't even do that as a joke! She's talented! Talented at being a failure, that is. I hate that she and I are related.

61
00:05:05,540 --> 00:05:11,540
Noelle, I have decided which magic night squad you'll be joining.

62
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:17,540
You'll be a black bull. It's already been settled.

63
00:05:17,540 --> 00:05:18,540
What?

64
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:22,540
Ah, the black bulls. The worst of them all. How very fitting.

65
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:29,540
They only do small missions in the sticks, don't they? Like hunting boars? Just your speed, Noelle.

66
00:05:29,540 --> 00:05:57,540
It's okay. It's okay. It's okay. It's okay. I went through all that training. I'll succeed. I can do it. I won't let you hurt my family anymore!

67
00:05:57,540 --> 00:06:04,540
Let's show her our power, Noelle. The House Silva stands strong.

68
00:06:04,540 --> 00:06:08,540
Great!

69
00:06:13,540 --> 00:06:21,540
Unfortunately for you, this is a sealed space. Which means that no matter what you do, your attacks won't reach me.

70
00:06:21,540 --> 00:06:28,540
Water creation magic! Sea Dragon's Lair!

71
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:37,540
You're just wasting magic and energy. What a shame. And I tried so hard to give you a peaceful death.

72
00:06:37,540 --> 00:06:46,540
She's too good. What am I going to do? Even with mana skin, Sea Dragon's Lair won't have any effect in here.

73
00:06:47,540 --> 00:06:50,540
Despite using all my strength, this is the best I can do.

74
00:06:50,540 --> 00:07:03,540
All I can manage now are simple movements at close range. There's only one strategy.

75
00:07:03,540 --> 00:07:08,540
You're quite determined. But I wonder how much longer you can keep this up.

76
00:07:11,540 --> 00:07:18,540
He's struggling. Come on, think! If Oster or the other Black Bulls were here, I bet they could come up with some crazy idea!

77
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:19,540
Crazy idea!

78
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:28,540
Damn it! If we don't figure out something to counteract our magic, we'll have no way out!

79
00:07:29,540 --> 00:07:30,540
No way out?

80
00:07:34,540 --> 00:07:38,540
I may not be able to use creation magic in such a controlled environment.

81
00:07:38,540 --> 00:07:43,540
But what if... I lose control?

82
00:07:45,540 --> 00:07:47,540
Nozel! Lend me a hand!

83
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:59,540
This is... I don't understand!

84
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:02,540
You fool!

85
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:06,540
You just plotted a completely enclosed space with water!

86
00:08:09,540 --> 00:08:12,540
Another Atlas can find everything within its fortress!

87
00:08:13,540 --> 00:08:17,540
If I don't want to be drowned in my own spell, I have no choice but to call it off!

88
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:31,540
You wretched human!

89
00:08:32,540 --> 00:08:40,540
No! I don't believe it! She annihilated me in a mere instant!

90
00:08:53,540 --> 00:08:58,540
Amazing! It makes sense from Nozel, but not from her.

91
00:08:58,540 --> 00:09:03,540
Um, guess we pulled it off, huh, Nozel?

92
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:09,540
Hey, I really appreciate you going along with my idea, even though it was a bit of a shot in the dark and all.

93
00:09:10,540 --> 00:09:15,540
It was certainly unorthodox. Fighting that way is unbefitting of royalty.

94
00:09:15,540 --> 00:09:19,540
But it still resulted in a victory for us.

95
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:24,540
You've learned many impressive things since you joined that squad.

96
00:09:25,540 --> 00:09:31,540
I had feared, because you looked so much like our late mother, that I might lose her a second time.

97
00:09:31,540 --> 00:09:40,540
I didn't expect you would ever become a strong person, so I decided that I had to protect you at any cost.

98
00:09:41,540 --> 00:09:44,540
I tried to keep you from the battlefield.

99
00:09:44,540 --> 00:09:53,540
But you proved me wrong, Noel. You're more capable now than I ever could have predicted you'd be.

100
00:09:53,540 --> 00:09:58,540
What I mean is...

101
00:09:59,540 --> 00:10:04,540
I... I apologize, Noel.

102
00:10:05,540 --> 00:10:09,540
Nozel apologized?

103
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:11,540
That's impossible!

104
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:14,540
Thank you, Nozel.

105
00:10:14,540 --> 00:10:15,540
Nozel?

106
00:10:15,540 --> 00:10:17,540
We aren't out of danger yet.

107
00:10:18,540 --> 00:10:20,540
We'd better see to Nebra's wounds.

108
00:10:24,540 --> 00:10:25,540
What?

109
00:10:26,540 --> 00:10:27,540
Nozel!

110
00:10:35,540 --> 00:10:38,540
How did this happen? Please wake up!

111
00:10:38,540 --> 00:10:42,540
I almost feel bad for you.

112
00:10:44,540 --> 00:10:47,540
You're trapped now. Here. In this place.

113
00:10:48,540 --> 00:10:53,540
There's no stopping it anymore. It's far too vast and powerful.

114
00:10:54,540 --> 00:10:58,540
You're lying! There has to be some way to escape from this madness!

115
00:10:59,540 --> 00:11:05,540
All you can do now is accept your fate. This is the price you'll pay for your sins, royals.

116
00:11:05,540 --> 00:11:09,540
I won't give up. There's a solution to this. I know there is!

117
00:11:10,540 --> 00:11:12,540
Think hard, Noel. You can defeat her!

118
00:11:13,540 --> 00:11:17,540
You finally proved yourself to your brother, right? So you can do anything!

119
00:11:18,540 --> 00:11:20,540
If you don't, Nozel and Nebra won't make it!

120
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:24,540
I would prefer to watch as you gradually give in to death.

121
00:11:25,540 --> 00:11:30,540
But I think I'll have mercy on you sinful human fools and get this over with quickly instead.

122
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:37,540
They've been cruel to me. But still, I won't let her take away my family!

123
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:45,540
Long-range spells are out. Magic manipulation, too.

124
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:50,540
I need something simple that packs a punch. Something that doesn't need to travel far.

125
00:11:51,540 --> 00:11:59,540
This is a spell I can only use because of where I am and who I am in this exact moment!

126
00:11:59,540 --> 00:12:06,540
In order to manifest a magic ability, the most crucial component is the user's natural talent.

127
00:12:07,540 --> 00:12:11,540
However, unwavering effort and training may also play a part.

128
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:17,540
In rare cases, a deeply heartfelt wish can grant power during a time of crisis.

129
00:12:17,540 --> 00:12:25,540
Many royal mages are able to acquire spells intuitively by employing their innate prowess and natural resourcefulness.

130
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:34,540
Because of their advantage, those individuals rarely undergo training, do research, or have their lives endangered on the battlefield.

131
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:45,540
Although Noelle possessed considerable magic power and talent, she also worked hard to improve herself and risked her life in combat many times alongside the Black Bulls.

132
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:56,540
Her long suffering, combined with her resolute desire to protect her siblings, gave her all the power she needed to overcome her current challenge.

133
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:58,540
Noelle!

134
00:13:24,540 --> 00:13:25,540
Noelle!

135
00:13:25,540 --> 00:13:26,540
Noelle!

136
