153
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:22,620
If I can find the slightest hole in your defense, this world I've created will rip your armor clean off!

154
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,940
Just moments ago, I was struggling.

155
00:14:27,940 --> 00:14:33,360
But now it feels like I've burst out of my cage.

156
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:38,920
I had no idea magic could make me feel so free.

157
00:14:41,380 --> 00:14:44,440
I wonder if this is the same feeling my mother had.

158
00:14:44,440 --> 00:15:00,180
Mother, the dancing princess of the battlefield.

159
00:15:00,180 --> 00:15:15,080
How? How did you cut through everything I threw at you?

160
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:22,520
It's over!

161
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:24,400
We'll build compass!

162
