174
00:16:42,940 --> 00:16:54,460
Come on, let's get Nozell and Nebra to safety!

175
00:16:54,460 --> 00:16:58,620
Oh no, I don't have enough magic left to fight these guys.

176
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:04,780
How dare you hurt Kiben? It appears we might have underestimated your strength, humans.

177
00:17:06,620 --> 00:17:09,740
But that will not happen again. Be gone!

178
00:17:12,940 --> 00:17:14,940
Solid behind you!

179
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:24,860
See? Now that's how you do a surprise attack.

180
00:17:24,860 --> 00:17:32,460
Not bad, huh? Even better when you double it.

181
00:17:32,460 --> 00:17:36,060
What kind of magic was that?

182
00:17:36,060 --> 00:17:38,060
I've never seen anything like it.

183
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:41,260
Damned, humans. Stay on guard.

184
00:17:41,260 --> 00:17:47,580
That last battle was flashy to say the least. So I kinda assumed it was gonna draw a crowd.

185
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:48,460
Sora!

186
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:53,340
Hey kid, don't you work for these people? Make yourself useful.

187
00:17:54,540 --> 00:17:58,060
What's the matter with you dragging me into something this dangerous?

188
00:17:58,060 --> 00:18:02,060
I'm the guy who saved your ass, remember? So you had better listen to me.

189
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:04,060
I can't!

190
00:18:04,060 --> 00:18:08,780
You can and you will. Now hop to it, kid, or you won't have masters anymore.

191
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:17,340
Hey, it's Lord Nozell and Lady Nebra! They need my help! Bubble recovery magic! Bubble refresher!

192
00:18:19,420 --> 00:18:21,900
Lord Solid, please bring Lord Nozell over here!

193
00:18:21,900 --> 00:18:24,620
Lord Solid!

194
00:18:24,620 --> 00:18:29,980
What's wrong? Are you taking a nap? Some royal magic knight you are, buddy.

195
00:18:30,540 --> 00:18:32,780
How could you let this chick beat all three of you?

196
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:37,820
Maybe if you snobs didn't run your mouse off all the time, you would fight better!

197
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:43,180
I mean, this moron here is a captain, and he couldn't even look out for his own family!

198
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:47,580
Nozell.

199
00:18:52,140 --> 00:18:56,860
You're finally getting your grimoire next year. I'm looking forward to finding out what sorts of

200
00:18:56,860 --> 00:18:58,460
amazing things you're going to do.

201
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:04,620
I'll learn spells of unparalleled power, so that I can become a strong magic knight captain just like

202
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:05,340
you are, mother.

203
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:10,700
That's great. Solid and Nebra both have water magic like your father does.

204
00:19:11,340 --> 00:19:14,140
And I have a feeling it might be the same for the little one, too.

205
00:19:15,260 --> 00:19:19,260
The only one of my children who inherited my steel attribute was you, dear,

206
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:22,220
so be sure that you use it to protect your siblings, okay?

207
00:19:26,620 --> 00:19:28,540
That's right. I should.

208
00:19:29,260 --> 00:19:33,580
Royals like you are supposed to be more powerful than us commoners, right?

209
00:19:33,580 --> 00:19:35,660
Come on, show a little spirit!

210
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:37,260
I think we've heard quite enough out of you-

211
00:19:37,260 --> 00:19:37,580
Stop!

212
00:19:37,580 --> 00:19:40,700
You- But Nozell, I don't-

213
00:19:41,820 --> 00:19:45,900
Everything he's saying is true. If I let this be the end of me,

214
00:19:47,180 --> 00:19:52,540
I'd be a disgrace. To the Royal House of Silva and the Silver Eagles.

215
00:19:53,180 --> 00:19:55,180
I'll reinforce my body with magic.

216
00:19:55,180 --> 00:20:00,460
He can fortify himself with mercury magic? What an advanced technique!

217
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:03,500
Are you ready, Noelle?

218
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:04,220
Yeah.

219
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:11,980
You snooty rich kids have so much magic power, it makes me sick. Tone it down some for the rest of us,

220
00:20:11,980 --> 00:20:15,980
would you? Ash magic! Revelation of the Cowardly!

221
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:24,300
Now! Take my magic with you, Noelle!

222
00:20:31,980 --> 00:20:33,020
I've got you!

223
00:20:33,020 --> 00:20:33,900
Not quite.

224
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:37,900
She's too fast.

225
00:20:37,900 --> 00:20:39,180
We'll catch her!

226
00:20:39,180 --> 00:20:43,980
It's trap magic.

227
00:20:43,980 --> 00:20:49,340
And there's more where that came from. The revelation of the Cowardly shows where I've placed

228
00:20:49,340 --> 00:20:55,180
each of my trap spells. The second they screw up, these royals will be all over them.

229
00:21:00,540 --> 00:21:03,420
In that condition, you won't be able to avoid this!

230
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:12,220
Noelle!

231
00:21:16,700 --> 00:21:19,340
He's not fazed at all by the strength of our spell.

232
00:21:19,900 --> 00:21:21,500
What kind of magic was that?

233
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:29,580
Bunch of amateurs. Guess you don't know about complicated techniques like my counter traps.

234
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:33,020
Water creation magic! Sea dragon's roar!

235
00:21:34,380 --> 00:21:37,420
It looks like your control is starting to falter, little girl.

236
00:21:39,180 --> 00:21:41,500
Mercury magic. Rain of silver!

237
00:21:43,660 --> 00:21:44,860
That's nothing to me!

238
00:21:51,500 --> 00:21:56,860
These spells have been evolving for years. It's complex human magic.

239
00:21:56,860 --> 00:21:59,740
But you elves wouldn't know about that either, would you?

240
00:21:59,740 --> 00:22:03,620
You elf.

241
00:22:29,740 --> 00:22:34,940
人生は全長だ

242
00:22:34,940 --> 00:22:39,440
そう感じることもある

